WEBVTT

1
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:45.916


2
00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:47.208
<b>In these verses,</b>

3
00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:49.375
<b>Lord Krishna tells Arjun that,</b>

4
00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:53.541
<b>For whoever is born, death is certain,</b>

5
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:55.333
<b>and after death,</b>

6
00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.416
<b>rebirth is certain.</b>

7
00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:59.500
<b>So when all this is destined,</b>

8
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.916
<b>bound to happen, then why grieve over it?</b>

9
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:03.833
<b>Moreover,</b>

10
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.208
<b>He explains,</b>

11
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:12.875
<b>All beings were unmanifest before birth,</b>
<b>became manifest between birth and death,</b>

12
00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:17.458
<b>and will again become unmanifest after death.</b>

13
00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:19.833
<b>This cycle continues,</b>

14
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:22.375
<b>so why sorrow?</b>

15
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:27.291


16
00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:31.166
<b>Whoever is born, their death is indeed certain.</b>

17
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:35.916
<b>And whoever passes through death's door,</b>
<b>will be born again.</b>

18
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:36.541
<b>Yes,</b>

19
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:38.291
<b>Arjun is a warrior,</b>

20
00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:40.500
<b>fighting is his duty,</b>

21
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.916
<b>and in this war, death will surely come to some.</b>

22
00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:48.666
<b>But if Arjun doesn't fulfill his duty,</b>
<b>doesn't fight this war,</b>

23
00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:51.416
<b>will death be postponed forever?</b>

24
00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:53.041
<b>This is impossible.</b>

25
00:01:53.041 --> 00:01:55.125
<b>Since death will come anyway,</b>

26
00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:56.125
<b>then in this case,</b>

27
00:01:56.125 --> 00:02:02.833
<b>Arjun should abandon this grief and</b>
<b>fulfill his warrior duty, he should fight.</b>

28
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:03.500
<b>Now,</b>

29
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.958
<b>speaking only of the body,</b>
<b>it's made of several elements.</b>

30
00:02:07.958 --> 00:02:10.583
<b>These elements existed before birth,</b>

31
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:15.000
<b>then at birth they combined to</b>
<b>take the form of a body,</b>

32
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.958
<b>we recognized this form,</b>

33
00:02:16.958 --> 00:02:18.375
<b>used it,</b>

34
00:02:18.375 --> 00:02:22.750
<b>and after death only this</b>
<b>form became unmanifest.</b>

35
00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.166
<b>The elements still exist,</b>

36
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:28.958
<b>they've just become unmanifest again,</b>
<b>as they were before.</b>

37
00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:33.041
<b>Understand this through the process of</b>
<b>an earthen pot's creation. </b>

38
00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:33.958
<b>Earth,</b>

39
00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:34.833
<b>Water,</b>

40
00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:35.750
<b>Fire,</b>

41
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.500
<b>Air,</b>

42
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.250
<b>Space.</b>

43
00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:42.708
<b>Earth provided the clay,</b>
<b>which was moistened with water,</b>

44
00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:45.583
<b>then a potter shaped this wet clay into a pot,</b>

45
00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:50.250
<b>using fire it was baked in a kiln,</b>

46
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.916
<b>that heated pot was then cooled by air,</b>

47
00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:57.000
<b>and the empty space inside that pot,</b>

48
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.125
<b>understand that as space.</b>

49
00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:02.375
<b>When that pot's lifespan ended,</b>

50
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:03.791
<b>it broke,</b>

51
00:03:03.791 --> 00:03:05.833
<b>did these elements perish?</b>

52
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:06.916
<b>No,</b>

53
00:03:06.916 --> 00:03:08.333
<b>the clay still exists,</b>

54
00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:09.916
<b>water either became vapor</b>

55
00:03:09.916 --> 00:03:12.125
<b>or merged with the pot's particles,</b>

56
00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:17.125
<b>air and fire too merged with</b>
<b>its particles while giving it form.</b>

57
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:22.583
<b>The empty space within the pot,</b>
<b>that space too remains unchanged.</b>

58
00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:23.958
<b>Krishna says here,</b>

59
00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:26.083
<b>this is how it is in life too,</b>

60
00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:27.333
<b>the elements remain the same,</b>

61
00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:31.916
<b>they just combined to take the form of a body,</b>

62
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:35.500
<b>and after death that form changed,</b>

63
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.000
<b>but the elements weren't destroyed.</b>

64
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.500
<b>So why grieve?</b>

65
00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.291
<b>Is this grief merely for a form?</b>

66
00:03:42.291 --> 00:03:46.458
<b>And if so, isn't that wrong?</b>

67
00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:48.083
<b>He wants to say,</b>

68
00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:49.000
<b>Arjun,</b>

69
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.208
<b>whether you look from a spiritual perspective,</b>

70
00:03:51.208 --> 00:03:53.041
<b>physical perspective,</b>

71
00:03:53.041 --> 00:03:55.000
<b>or a mixture of both,</b>

72
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.666
<b>grief is meaningless.</b>

73
00:03:58.291 --> 00:04:01.791


74
00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:05.875
<b>You too have received education in some field,</b>

75
00:04:05.875 --> 00:04:07.708
<b>taken examinations</b>

76
00:04:07.708 --> 00:04:09.875
<b>you'll understand this point.</b>

77
00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:11.916
<b>Now suppose</b>

78
00:04:11.916 --> 00:04:19.750
<b>someone entered university but refused to</b>
<b>accept the concept of exams.</b>

79
00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.958
<b>Made no preparation at all.</b>

80
00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:26.125
<b>Will He/She pass?</b>

81
00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:28.625
<b>What would you call such a student?</b>

82
00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:31.416
<b>Perhaps foolish, stubborn</b>

83
00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:33.416
<b>or careless.</b>

84
00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:35.083
<b>Similarly,</b>

85
00:04:35.083 --> 00:04:40.291
<b>birth too is like admission into life's university</b>

86
00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:42.291
<b>this school teaches us,</b>

87
00:04:42.291 --> 00:04:48.458
<b>prepares us, and then comes</b>
<b>the final examination</b>

88
00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:50.666
<b>Death.</b>

89
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:55.416
<b>And this final exam's result determines</b>

90
00:04:55.416 --> 00:04:57.833
<b>whether you progress</b>

91
00:04:57.833 --> 00:04:59.958
<b>or regress.</b>

92
00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:06.541
<b>The Gita contains detailed descriptions about</b>
<b>the journey after this exam, after death,</b>

93
00:05:06.541 --> 00:05:08.958
<b>but that's for later.</b>

94
00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:11.875
<b>Here, the only question that arises is</b>

95
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:17.958
<b>a person having taken birth,</b>
<b>having entered life's school,</b>

96
00:05:17.958 --> 00:05:19.125
<b>but</b>

97
00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:23.500
<b>is he preparing for this final exam?</b>

98
00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:29.125
<b>Or is he refusing to</b>
<b>even acknowledge this exam?</b>

99
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:32.708
<b>Man has no control over birth</b>

100
00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:35.000
<b>or death.</b>

101
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.166
<b>What's in his control is only this</b>

102
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:43.708
<b>that he prepares for this death,</b>
<b>for this examination.</b>

103
00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:46.041
<b>And this preparation can be done...</b>

104
00:05:46.041 --> 00:05:49.041
<b>by understanding one's spiritual existence,</b>

105
00:05:49.041 --> 00:05:52.333
<b>by increasing knowledge about it,</b>

106
00:05:52.333 --> 00:05:56.208
<b>by living life from a spiritual perspective.</b>

107
00:05:56.208 --> 00:05:57.875
<b>Tell me?</b>

108
00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:04.916
<b>How are you spending this</b>
<b>academic session of life's school?</b>

109
00:06:04.916 --> 00:06:08.166
<b>Are you preparing for the exam?</b>

110
00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:11.041
<b>Or have you forgotten about it?</b>

111
00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:18.625
<b>Or are you spending this session in sorrow,</b>
<b>constantly thinking about the exam?</b>

112
00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:21.041
<b>You know too, don't you,</b>

113
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:23.666
<b>what the right path is...</b>

114
00:06:23.666 --> 00:06:26.208
<b>to receive life's education,</b>

115
00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:29.625
<b>to stay prepared for the exam.</b>

116
00:06:29.625 --> 00:06:34.041
<b>Will anything come from grief?</b>

117
00:06:34.041 --> 00:06:35.208
<b>No, right?</b>

118
00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:39.833


119
00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:42.458
<b>Death</b>

120
00:06:42.458 --> 00:06:47.000
<b>is an extremely sensitive subject,</b>

121
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.833
<b>Our death is certain,</b>

122
00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:56.541
<b>the death of family members is certain,</b>

123
00:06:56.541 --> 00:07:03.333
<b>yet how difficult it is to talk about this subject.</b>

124
00:07:03.333 --> 00:07:07.791
<b>This topic fills family members with anxiety.</b>

125
00:07:07.791 --> 00:07:08.916
<b>Yes,</b>

126
00:07:08.916 --> 00:07:14.291
<b>talking about it depends on others,</b>

127
00:07:14.291 --> 00:07:15.333
<b>but</b>

128
00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:17.708
<b>understanding this subject yourself</b>

129
00:07:17.708 --> 00:07:21.833
<b>that depends only on you, doesn't it?</b>

130
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:26.833
<b>And when you truly embrace </b>
<b>this truth in its real sense,</b>

131
00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:29.875
<b>this thought won't make you anxious,</b>

132
00:07:29.875 --> 00:07:34.375
<b>but will make you feel lighter.</b>

133
00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:36.250
<b>Think about it.</b>

134
00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:41.000
<b>When you know that time</b>
<b>with family members is limited,</b>

135
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.000
<b>why not</b>

136
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.458
<b>spend it with mutual love?</b>

137
00:07:45.458 --> 00:07:48.041
<b>When you know time is limited,</b>

138
00:07:48.041 --> 00:07:52.583
<b>then why live a life that's purposeless,</b>

139
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:57.000
<b>that doesn't bring joy to your mind?</b>

140
00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.583
<b>Why not search for life's purpose,</b>

141
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:05.416
<b>and do all those things that</b>
<b>give you true knowledge</b>

142
00:08:05.416 --> 00:08:07.333
<b>and happiness,</b>

143
00:08:07.333 --> 00:08:11.666
<b>and also help others in their difficult lives?</b>

144
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:14.916
<b>How liberating is this thought.</b>

145
00:08:14.916 --> 00:08:18.041
<b>Think about it.</b>

146
00:08:18.041 --> 00:08:20.416
<b>Death isn't in your hands,</b>

147
00:08:20.416 --> 00:08:21.375
<b>but</b>

148
00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:25.708
<b>but how to live this life</b>

149
00:08:25.708 --> 00:08:29.458
<b>that's certainly under your control, isn't it?</b>

150
00:08:30.166 --> 00:08:34.375


151
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:38.750
<b>This cycle of birth and death will continue.</b>

152
00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:41.208
<b>Life is a limited duration.</b>

153
00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:43.500
<b>And if the duration is limited,</b>

154
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.791
<b>why not spend it well,</b>

155
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:49.666
<b>and why not remain humble,</b>

156
00:08:49.666 --> 00:08:50.666
<b>because</b>

157
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:52.208
<b>king or pauper,</b>

158
00:08:52.208 --> 00:08:53.958
<b>big or small,</b>

159
00:08:53.958 --> 00:09:00.375
<b>after death all will merge into these elements.</b>

160
00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:04.291
<b>We can compare this to professional life too.</b>

161
00:09:04.291 --> 00:09:07.375
<b>Success too has a cycle.</b>

162
00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:08.541
<b>Sometimes success,</b>

163
00:09:08.541 --> 00:09:09.541
<b>sometimes defeat,</b>

164
00:09:09.541 --> 00:09:11.375
<b>and then success again.</b>

165
00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:16.250
<b>What goes up can come down too.</b>

166
00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:19.041
<b>This awareness is essential.</b>

167
00:09:19.041 --> 00:09:23.333
<b>It will help you in three ways:</b>

168
00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:24.375
<b>First</b>

169
00:09:24.375 --> 00:09:27.250
<b>that professional success is temporary</b>

170
00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:32.125
<b>so don't be egotistical about it. Remain humble.</b>

171
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:33.208
<b>Second</b>

172
00:09:33.208 --> 00:09:36.625
<b>professional failure too is temporary,</b>

173
00:09:36.625 --> 00:09:38.625
<b>don't be anxious.</b>

174
00:09:38.625 --> 00:09:40.750
<b>Keep doing your work,</b>

175
00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:45.958
<b>soon success will come to you too.</b>

176
00:09:45.958 --> 00:09:47.750
<b>And third</b>

177
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:52.166
<b>that a day will come when this cycle will stop,</b>

178
00:09:52.166 --> 00:09:58.416
<b>and you'll have to leave your position,</b>
<b>your place for someone else.</b>

179
00:09:58.416 --> 00:10:00.375
<b>Why grieve over this,</b>

180
00:10:00.375 --> 00:10:03.375
<b>this was bound to happen.</b>

181
00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:06.291
<b>You did your work well</b>

182
00:10:06.291 --> 00:10:10.666
<b>how peaceful is this thought in itself.</b>

